Найти “виновные” таблицы с избыточным числом партиций:
SELECT database, table, countDistinct(partition_id) AS partitions, count() AS parts FROM system.parts WHERE active GROUP BY database, table ORDER BY partitions DESC LIMIT 20;
Посмотреть последние ошибки INSERT с кодом 252:
SELECT event_time, initial_query_id, query_kind, query, exception_code, exception FROM system.query_log WHERE type='ExceptionWhileProcessing' AND exception_code=252 ORDER BY event_time DESC LIMIT 50;
Проверить состояние репликаций (если Replicated*):
SELECT database, table, is_leader, absolute_delay, queue_size, last_queue_update_exception FROM system.replicas ORDER BY queue_size DESC LIMIT 20;
Корреляция с Keeper:
SELECT event_type, event_time FROM system.zookeeper_log WHERE event_type IN ('connection_loss','session_expired') ORDER BY event_time DESC LIMIT 100;



SELECT event_time, initial_user, address, database, table, query, exception_code, exception FROM system.query_log WHERE type='ExceptionWhileProcessing' AND exception_code=252 ORDER BY event_time DESC LIMIT 50;




Если известна формула PARTITION BY для таблицы (например, toYYYYMM(date)), можно на стороне ClickHouse воспроизвести для примера:
SELECT countDistinct(toYYYYMM(date)) FROM <их_источник_данных_или_временная_таблица>;
В качестве прокси‑метрики — частота 252 в query_log у их пользователя/сервиса по времени:
SELECT toStartOfMinute(event_time) AS ts, initial_user, database, table, count() AS errors FROM system.query_log WHERE type='ExceptionWhileProcessing' AND exception_code=252 GROUP BY ts, initial_user, database, table ORDER BY ts DESC LIMIT 100;










